global gGameTime

on mouseUp
  [  0] pushint8 4 .............................. <4>
  [  2] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <4>
  [  4] extcall 55 .............................. cursor(4)
  [  6] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [  8] pushint8 34 ............................. <34>
  [ 10] pusharglistnoret 2 ...................... <1, 34>
  [ 12] extcall 54 .............................. puppetSound(1, 34)
  [ 14] pushint8 100 ............................ <100>
  [ 16] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <100>
  [ 18] extcall 4 ............................... shuffle(100)
  [ 20] pusharglist 0 ........................... <>
  [ 22] extcall 5 ............................... <check_completed()>
  [ 24] jmpifz [ 43] ............................ repeat while check_completed()
  [ 27] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 29] pushint8 34 ............................. <34>
  [ 31] pusharglistnoret 2 ...................... <1, 34>
  [ 33] extcall 54 .............................. puppetSound(1, 34)
  [ 35] pushint8 100 ............................ <100>
  [ 37] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <100>
  [ 39] extcall 4 ............................... shuffle(100)
  [ 41] endrepeat [ 20]
  [ 43] pusharglistnoret 0 ...................... <>
  [ 45] extcall 1 ............................... render_game()
  [ 47] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 48] pushint8 34 ............................. <34>
  [ 50] set 7 ................................... set the timer to 0
  [ 52] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 54] inv ..................................... <-1>
  [ 55] setglobal 47 ............................ gGameTime = -1
  [ 57] pusharglistnoret 0 ...................... <>
  [ 59] extcall 82 .............................. unloadMember()
  [ 61] pushcons 0 .............................. <"gameloop">
  [ 63] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <"gameloop">
  [ 65] extcall 46 .............................. go("gameloop")
  [ 67] ret
end
